{"job_id":"F-5e1b9ee0ec64baf3658e","family_id":"F-5e1b9ee0ec64baf3658e","title":"국회에서의증인등비용지급에관한규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006017-35771-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":17,"target_id":"366e5e09bc7dc82bbe986bd88f6e183b9238fe07f7277838a7edc3f5edba84bd","source_hash":"512356b745e1eadaf1426a7e6815a793e1f88b7841023fdf2d5e4af4ffaa1b3b","text":"国民议会证人等费用支付规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006017-35771-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":117,"target_id":"c4f4fb05c82f61e3d4bef099769381ea68becdbe356d635048397c5dca3e5682","source_hash":"16ea5a45b57320cb61478a9c4eb9c813f87be0bfe9597eb14a137f370c7d2958","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《国民议会证人、专家证人等法》第十一条的规定，规定向证人、专家证人和参考人（以下统称“证人等”）支付费用的标准。<1995年3月18日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006017-35771-ko","scope":"BODY","start":117,"end":246,"target_id":"ab1c2d8fc7e7c433f8aee40b46cd40bec8b1472362fef359124ea1a19caa7a17","source_hash":"1cfea9bc522edb343b053275a65cef6f3284285ee60f85fac81d80c2f1e3c5d2","text":"第二条（费用）\n① 支付给证人等的费用应包括运费（铁路、轮船、航空和汽车）、当地交通费、住宿费、食品费和餐饮费。\n② 除第 1 款规定的费用外，如果主席认为评估特别必要，可以另行支付评估费。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006017-35771-ko","scope":"BODY","start":246,"end":364,"target_id":"6b64c22cb8005e9dbeec406ec6b3064ba6ca87dc56eb3cb90ec30ef974458a74","source_hash":"23334ac420172aef8a68032a72aa02defb240695cae69ebeb312b267ff10e318","text":"第三条（费用支付的例外情况）凡属下列情形之一的，不得支付费用。\n1. 国民议会议员\n2. 内阁成员·政府成员\n3. 已从其所属机构获得单独费用报销的公职人员、国有企业和政府投资机构的管理人员和雇员\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006017-35771-ko","scope":"BODY","start":364,"end":425,"target_id":"172ea1fea0e6c85e029e221d4f606e63f4d723efc8b7e31e496fddf1b113e0a6","source_hash":"8421d5b1252a6134f99d78a707ff29d5844d921a50df61455293a929a521123d","text":"第四条（费用支付标准）关于证人等费用的支付，适用《政府国内差旅费条例》附件二第三款的规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006017-35771-ko","scope":"BODY","start":425,"end":524,"target_id":"0fc33803f70322d163b6c255ab9a8a63b90791a08bbc39edd18124e602e45909","source_hash":"f2905e1008c47ada518d6f6493d23bb5c6d6a0d5088b9036e687a7a2a82ab77b","text":"第五条（费用支付天数的计算）向证人等支付的当地交通费、住宿费和餐费，应当按照证人等在国民议会或指定地点作证之日起的停留天数计算。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006017-35771-ko","scope":"BODY","start":524,"end":603,"target_id":"e6f63a94439aa21774050a2dd5df9684d52cf36a94fb1b88308cce1079e9efc4","source_hash":"3282ff96192ecd0b61f607e38a6c0ebac3de325f8f7f516586aeb9528c41c292","text":"第六条（费用支付限制） 如有明确理由认定证人等作出虚假陈述或专家意见，则不得支付费用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006017-35771-ko","scope":"BODY","start":603,"end":650,"target_id":"775e92171bbb013aab248526cc9642939895a5bce821f6cd6e265ee2eb81f111","source_hash":"343288879fe8f1bb5353833d87e660eff951ad6ec2199142f641f9d980a76bf2","text":"补充规定 <1981年3月30日第8号>\n\n该规定自1981年4月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006017-35771-ko","scope":"BODY","start":650,"end":690,"target_id":"8568088b3672fb7327f812c8a2d52d606abd2ad8c845e8adb99f58a0b8b8ae93","source_hash":"34958182a49b1b96371044e3a6cb314ad1f74fd2f1f0e92676df76c2672135a4","text":"补充规定 <1995年3月18日第92号>\n\n本规则自决议通过之日起生效。"}]}